# WolkaraForever layer patch 0045: shared guest scale and window-sized virtual display.
# Preserve logical coordinates and guest-owned drawable sizing; publish folds/resizes.
#
# Rebased onto Tolkara edc3628: upstream added AKScreenGameSize/AKScreenSetGameSize (the
# game area less touch-control columns), AKBackingScale and per-process callback gating
# (AKEnterProcessCallback). The published window geometry wins when there is one, then
# upstream's game size, then the screen; display callbacks stay inside upstream's gate; the
# declarations join upstream's existing __OBJC__ block; upstream's CGDisplayPixelsWide
# assertion in tests/test_displays.m now expects the configured scale.
#
